      <p class="kp-section-body">Pick the concern you actually deal with and go straight to the Kairali Ayurvedic products grouped for it.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="kp-grid kp-grid--concerns">
      {% render 'kairali-premium-card',
        id: 'concern-01', href: '/collections/diabetes', background: 'kp-in-home-r03-concern-01.webp', tone: 'light', card_modifier: 'kp-card--concern',
        eyebrow: 'Kairali Ayurvedic range', heading: 'Ayurvedic Blood Sugar & Metabolic Wellness',
        body: 'The Kairali Ayurvedic products grouped under blood sugar and metabolic wellness, gathered on one page rather than scattered through the catalogue.',
